error[E3013]  a/a.canon:13:24
  a table holds records; a.Rarity is not a record

error[E2102]  a/a.canon:15:28
  unknown name Nope

error[E2102]  a/a.canon:17:18
  unknown name Nope

error[E2102]  b/b.canon:12:19
  unknown name id

error[E2102]  c/c.canon:10:19
  unknown name id

5 errors, 0 warnings in 4 packages (…)
